5529	        // SUCCESSFUL result, though: an errored component_render never rendered
5530	        // live (and an errored component_unmount never removed anything), so
5531	        // re-applying its saved args would mount a phantom component (or wrongly
5532	        // drop one) on reconnect. For a failed result we fall through and let it
5533	        // hydrate as the failed ToolCall block the live session showed.
5534	        if entry.role == "tool" && !entry.is_error.unwrap_or(false) {
